main argc=1
%load FILE             define FILE's names in this session; nothing runs (also .L)
%call FILE[(ARGS)]     FILE loaded, then the function named after it called with ARGS, else FILE's main (also .x)
%quit                  end the session (also .q, .exit)
Each name is also written with `:` or `.` (`:type EXPR`, `.L FILE`).
